    "body": "Thanks! I can think of a few minor changes that would improve things while working in this area:\n- Move `text/event-stream` to be adjacent to the other MIME types. So, please it after `application/microdata+json`.\n- Move `Last-Event-ID` to be adjacent to the other headers. So, place it after `Ping-To`.\n- Add backticks around `Last-Event-ID`, like the other headers. (This is part of #161.)\n",
